the **Draft group** into hurry controls on the right (and a **new draft button**) and config options on the right. Add building list filtering buttons ("Show All Buildings", "Show Regular Buildings Only", "Show National Wonders Only", "Show World Wonders Only") and restored **Production Chooser Bar** row-jump buttons with clearer hover text ("Scroll to Units/Buildings/Wonders"). Reduce **food/production top bars' size** so text does not overflow when upscaled (also helps preserve overall distance to side panels due to increasing base font size from body to label). Add **commerce sliders fast increment buttons** (`++ and --` optional buttons ("Min/Max Buttons in BUG Menu")) in city screen (matching the ones in map view) (not added in Finance Tab or Espionage Tab because these still have access to commerce sliders as of now at their right in map view). Change in [CvMainInterface.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvMainInterface.py). Adjust **city camera** to the north (tunable) so extra rows can be shown without overflowing into bottom BFC plots in `CvGame::onCityScreenChange`. And other changes. See also [KI#101](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues.md#101---fixed-base-advciv-bug-of-gp-bar-tooltip-in-city-screen-not-showing-gp-from-obsolete-buildings-yet-seemingly-counting-them-for-the-total-gp-calculation).
 - **Main Interface (Map View)**: **Reordered buttons** (end turn, city change arrows) and wrapped them in a **pretty panel**. Added buttons to unit stack, selected unit. Added **help text box** (`DefaultHelpArea`) (on the left side) optional **width adjustment** (negative value shrinks it). Make **x and y positions** (resolution-scaled), and **width** (hard pixel; not resolution-scaled) of the **unit bar** (`PlotListPanel`) **adjustable**, and **fix horizontal overflow of unit bar into scoreboard** when unit bar is full and scoreboard is hovered on (or toggle lock scoreboard hover is ON) (see [KI#124](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues.md#124---fixed-likely-base-advciv-issue-map-view-unit-bar-overflows-into-hoveredexpanded-scoreboard)). Make **left-click on GP bar** open the **corresponding city's city screen**. Added a **Toggle show map annotations** (Alt + S **captions**, Alt + X **BFC marks**) button (next to the other buttons **above the Minimap**); the toggled state **persists on save and load**; reorganized buttons as part of this change (this takes the Event Log's former HUD icon former (it gets another one instead)). To accommodate this new minimap button's width, **reduce minimap buttons horizontal interspacing** so **last minimap button doesn't collide horizontally with globe view** button (except for squarish maps like as of now `BTG_Cross.py`, where this is a fine trade-off, and still improved significantly with this adjustment). See [README.md (Map annotations)](/README.md#map-annotations) and [KI#135](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues.md#135---fixed-likely-base-advciv-issue-turn-status-text-collided-with-the-diplomacy-screen).
